  "not_replayed": "The three lookahead tests of runtime_tests.rs stage the packets kept behind and the held packet through Peer::keep_behind and the peer's cold state instead of reading them from a socket. mut-wait (a reader that never closes) has no replay of its own: the two closing tests show the close it lacks.",
